  "content": "\n\n<p>使用設定檔與兩種配方類型，增加了大量苦力怕變種<br><br>當它們爆炸時，若附近有石頭方塊（可自訂設定），這些方塊就會被轉化為礦石方塊</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>首先設置陷阱</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>接著在陷阱內放置物品</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>陷阱完成苦力怕的轉換後，讓其在特定方塊（例如普通石頭）周圍爆炸，將其轉化為礦石方塊</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>範例設定檔與兩種 JSON 配方可於<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查看</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LqDnGJr.gif\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/LqDnGJr.gif\" width=\"850\" height=\"496\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>另一個範例：青金石苦力怕爆炸</p>\n<p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fQyCtWtW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW.gif\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW.gif\" width=\"850\" height=\"496\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;-</p>\n<p>本模組基於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE </a>與 FLIB 開發 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若要為整合包自訂此模組，請建立原版 Datapack，和/或使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker</a>。範例請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\">r</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
